# Skyborne (Alliance) 1-12: Zephras Isle
# Alliance Skyborne leave by zeppelin to Dalaran, then take the Skyborne portal to Stormwind.
# Order from plan_zone.py (routes/drafts/SkyborneA_ZephrasIsle.route, time-optimised; --keep for the first quests, which
# open the class quests and the island's chains), then edited by hand: class quests, training, the Shen'dar
# Village hearthstone and the way off the island. Zephras Isle's map size is an estimate (two airship docks),
# so the plan's timings are rougher than elsewhere.
guide Skyborne (Alliance) 1-12 Zephras Isle
file SkyborneA_ZephrasIsle
faction Alliance
races Skyborne
levels 1 13
map 2521
next Alliance 11-14 Darkshore

