# Leave the island: the zeppelin to Dalaran, then the Skyborne portal to Stormwind
train ZephrasSouth
go @65.8,83.4 | Take the zeppelin at the Valanaar dock to Dalaran.
accept 94947 || Denaaris Stargale waits where the zeppelin docks in Dalaran.
note Take the Skyborne portal next to Denaaris Stargale to Stormwind.
turnin 94947 || Highlord Bolvar Fordragon is in Stormwind Keep.
train Stormwind
getfp Stormwind @71.3,72.2,1453 {npc=Dungar Longdrink}

# On to the shared Alliance route: Alliance 11-14 Darkshore
train Stormwind
note Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine.
